      "label": "I2C native Main checks",
      "checks": 138
    }
  ],
  "scope": "Hosted execution of the unchanged actual native I2C Main with modeled controller facade, channel service, startup handles, logging and syscall boundaries. Actual binding decoder, control-event decoder and launch types are used. 23 cases cover MSI finite waits, polling fallback, startup refusal/retention, IPC wake/reply, Stop dispatch, bounded event batches, idle deadlines and malformed notice envelopes. This suite does not execute the actual controller/service bodies; tests/i2c-interrupt-wait covers that separate composition.",
  "newProof": false,
  "nativeExecuted": false,
  "hardwareValidated": false
}
